==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[dragon]]'s [[blood]]|-}}

# A bright [[red]] [[resin]] that is obtained from different species of a number of distinct [[plant]] [[genera]]: ''[[Croton]]'', ''[[Dracaena]]'', ''[[Daemonorops]]'', ''[[Calamus rotang]]'' and ''[[Pterocarpus]]'' and is used in the manufacture of [[varnish]]es, [[lacquer]]s, [[medicine]]s, and [[incense]]s.

